  "releaseNotes": "Adds Heatmap, Radar, Funnel, BoxPlot, Candlestick, Treemap and Sunburst; shared chart animation and cache improvements; AttachmentList, DataGrid row numbers and workflow/dialog integration. Preview pages retain visited content, editing and focus without repeated editor mounting; removes the shared source footer and empty reference placeholders. Includes bilingual guides and measured performance limits. Requires .NET 10 and Avalonia 12.1.4; upgrade both TheOne packages to preview.9. NuGet upload is manual.",
